   229	    """Return the action-independent realised fading gain at the actual elevation.
   230	
   231	    Shadow and Rician components use separate stable keys.  Elevation is not
   232	    part of either key: two elevations therefore reuse the same standard-
   233	    normal variate while the elevation-dependent shadow sigma and
